  "details": "I've wanted this for a long time but forget to bring it up: I think we should have the ability to Map Seated/Standing to a button on our controls, so we don't have to go into the QM Everytime we just want to sit or stand.\n\nI've always personally wanted it as a Stick Click action, and when using regular controls such as PS4 or Xbox-- That's how it works-- Clicking the stick makes you crouch and stand, but that just isn't an option with regular VR inputs.\n\nSo I'd definitely love to see it, and I hope it isn't an overly big ask-- For me and the few I've asked, it'd be a huge QoL improvement!",
